- **Residency not measured:** the RHI has no memory-usage query, so every run reports "residency was not measured". I re-checked this and it still holds. The fix is implementable without your decision: DX12 `IDXGIAdapter3::QueryVideoMemoryInfo`, Vulkan `VK_EXT_memory_budget`, and the host working set behind one accessor. I have not started it.
- **full_1080:** needs the FSR 2 shader permutation tables, which the vendored tree lacks. Which vendoring route to take is your call.
- **Native Linux Vulkan GPU and linux-gcc:** not run. WSL has no Vulkan device, and GCC 9.4 cannot build Jolt.

